" Tridactyl config. Needs the native messenger (:nativeinstall) to load from disk.

sanitise tridactyllocal tridactylsync

" Google apps: go{key} opens here, gn{key} opens in a new tab
quickmark c https://calendar.google.com/calendar/
quickmark m https://mail.google.com/mail/
quickmark d https://docs.google.com/document/
quickmark s https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/
quickmark p https://docs.google.com/presentation/

" These apps have their own keyboard shortcuts; keep Tridactyl out of the way
autocmd DocStart calendar.google.com mode ignore
autocmd DocStart mail.google.com mode ignore
autocmd DocStart docs.google.com mode ignore
